	)
	(text "Hub: DN1 supervisor, DN2 bridge A, DN3 bridge B, DN4 service. No EEPROM: CFG_SEL 00, NON_REM 11, self powered, individual switching. TEST to GND. OCS_N1-4 open (internal pull-up).\nFDCAN1_RX on PB8-BOOT0: program option bytes to ignore the pin before first run. PA15 released from JTDI for FDCAN3_TX. Firmware: budgetcan_fw, candleLight has no G474 build.\nService USB-C sits on a hub downstream port, so it is a host port: a laptop cannot reach the board through it. Rp 56k, default USB current."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 190.5 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "03c576c6-b6f4-54a4-8796-a76790eba10b")
	)
